  "title": "Removing humans from the loop has become a status symbol.",
  "summary": "The pitch: ticket in, code out, revenue up, headcount flat. Then someone, usually someone who manages billions, fresh from shipping a vibe-coded to-do list, asks why everyone cannot do the same. Billing moves money and trust. Healthcare, insurance, security, logistics and infrastructure also change states other people rely on. These companies are not less AI-native. Their workflows are less forgiving. The right mental model is not how far an agent can go. It is where it should stop. 1. The",
